{
  "name": "The Master's Presence",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an Action, you can exude your patron's frightening presence in a radius of 60 feet. Every creature of your choice in the area that is aware of you, must make a Wisdom Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, it is Frightened of you for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a creature's Saving Throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the creature is Immune to your Frightful Presence for the next 24 hours.</p><p>You cannot use this feature again until you have finished a Long Rest.</p>",
